source.toml:1:1 sources.missing: missing required key "url"
source.toml:5:7 sources.no_list.url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ" is not a playlist or channel URL: use a playlist (with list=<playlist id>) or a channel (/@handle, /channel/UC…, /c/name, /user/name)
source.toml:8:7 sources.bare_id.url: "PLcccccccc" is not a URL; use the playlist's or channel's URL (e.g. "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxxxxxxxx" or "https://www.youtube.com/@channel")
source.toml:11:7 sources.not_youtube.url: "https://example.com/playlist?list=PLdddddddd" is not a YouTube URL (e.g. "https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxxxxxxxx" or "https://www.youtube.com/@channel")
source.toml:15:12 sources.bad_category.category: "Music!" isn't a category name: use lowercase letters, digits, '-' and '_'
